# Generated from the .nw sources (§13); the .nw files are the only authority.
# notangle re-creates these on `nix develop`. flake.nix is the one exception:
# Nix must read it, so it stays committed and the dogfood check guards it.
/src/*.rs
/templates/lit.css
/templates/lit-syntax.css
